    "scene": "2D 16 x 15 cells (1.6 x 1.5 um, mesh 0.1 um), three-cell PML on every wall, one Gaussian point source (wavelength 1.1 um, 20 fs FWHM, 50 fs centre) at (-0.2, 0, 0), three point monitors, float32, epsilon 1.7, CPU tiles, slab width 16 (one tile), four torch threads",
